translate es qst_HumanExp_11_returnFlowers_3314daed:

    # REGINA @ talk "If you're going to be risking your life and presumably she'll be there to protect you, it only makes sense she then eats what you kill."
    REGINA @ talk "Si vas a arriesgar tu vida y presumiblemente ella estará ahí para protegerte, lo lógico es que luego se coma lo que mates."

