    # REGINA @ talk "She will just come crawling straight back, and now, other slimelarks are likely to reject her."
    REGINA @ talk "Volverá arrastrándose, y ahora es probable que otros slimelarks la rechacen."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:832
